    "sections": {
        "description": "<h4>Like Box Widget &amp; Shortcode &#8211; Social Profile</h4>\n<p>A very easy and simple Facebook like box widget &amp; shortcode plugin for wordPress websites/blogs.</p>\n<p>You can promote any page with like box. It is also responsive so you can use it on any page and post.</p>\n<p>You can attract visitor to your page with like box and divert your site traffic to your page.</p>\n<p>To activate like box widget on your website. Go to widgets area in admin dashboard, find the &#8220;Like box Widget&#8221; named widget and activate in any widget of theme.</p>\n<p>For pages and groups you can choose the user roles whose posts will be shared- page owner/ group admin, group member/page fans or both. Hashtags and mentions included in posts will be preserved. The page plugin comes with a number of great features and functionality to allow you create anything from free simple feeds to custom feeds, including group events, like box, feed gallery and more to increase engagement of your fans.</p>\n<p><strong>Major features in Like Box plugin include:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Like box Widget</li>\n<li>Like box Shortcode</li>\n<li>Custom Application ID</li>\n<li>Custom Widget Title</li>\n<li>Widget Custom Width (Min Width: 180 &#8211; Max Width: 500)</li>\n<li>Widget Custom Height (Min Height: 70 )</li>\n<li>Full Width Widget</li>\n<li>Show Page Cover</li>\n<li>Show Page Header</li>\n<li>Small And Large Page Header</li>\n<li>Show Friends</li>\n<li>Show Page Post/Stream</li>\n<li>43 Language support for like box</li>\n</ul>\n",
        "installation": "<p>Install like box Widget &amp; Shortcode either via the WordPress.org plugin directory or by uploading the files to your server.</p>\n<p>After activating Install like box Widget &amp; Shortcode, go to widgets menu under appearance menu.</p>\n<p>Find the widget named with &#8216;like box Widget and shortcode&#8217;.</p>\n<p>Now drag and drop the widget in available widget areas into your theme.</p>\n<p>Finally, configure your widget setting and save.</p>\n<p>That&#8217;s it. You&#8217;re ready to go!</p>\n<h4>Recommended Plugins</h4>\n<p>The following are other recommended plugins by the author:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Create Free <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/portfolio-filter-gallery/\" rel=\"ugc\">Portfolio Filter Gallery</a> Best Portfolio Filter Gallery &#8211; The Gallery Plugin to create awesome Portfolio Filter Gallery Plugin in minutes. Get <a href=\"http://awplife.com/product/portfolio-filter-gallery-premium/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Portfolio Filter Gallery Pro</a> now.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Embed Free <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/wp-flickr-gallery/\" rel=\"ugc\">Flickr Gallery</a> &#8211; Awesome Flickr Gallery &#8211; The Gallery Plugin to create awesome Flickr Album And Phot stream Gallery. Grab the <a href=\"http://awplife.com/product/flickr-gallery-premium/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Flickr Gallery Premium</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Free <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/event-monster/\" rel=\"ugc\">Event Manager</a> &#8211; This plugin is use to create and manage events.  Get Perfect Event Management plugin &#8211; <a href=\"http://awplife.com/product/event-monster-premium/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Event Monster Premium</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Free Addon <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/media-slider/\" rel=\"ugc\">Media Slider</a> &#8211; The Media Slider Plugin to create Media / Video Slider Gallery Plugin in minutes. Buy The Best Media Slider plugin <a href=\"http://awplife.com/product/media-slider-premium/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Media Slider Premium</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Best Free <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/weather-effect/\" rel=\"ugc\">Weather Effect Plugin</a> &#8211; Very Simple And Easy To Design Your Sites With Multiple Effects. Buy Best <a href=\"http://awplife.com/product/weather-effect-premium/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Weather Effect Premium</a> plugin.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Display Free <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/new-grid-gallery/\" rel=\"ugc\">Grid Gallery Plugin</a> &#8211; Easy Grid Gallery Widget: Displaying your image in Page &amp; Post widget/sidebar area with very easy.Allows you to customize it to looking exactly what you want. Get the <a href=\"http://awplife.com/product/grid-gallery-premium/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Grid Gallery Premium</a> now.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Free <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/new-social-media-widget/\" rel=\"ugc\">Social Media Plugin</a> &#8211; Display your Social Media Plugin into Widget/Sidebar in WordPress site with very easily. Purchase the <a href=\"http://awplife.com/product/social-media-widget-premium//\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Social Media Widget Premium</a> plugin.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Free Plugin <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/new-photo-gallery/\" rel=\"ugc\">Photo Gallery Plugin</a> &#8211; Displays all  Photo Gallery, Video Gallery, Link Gallery, Map Gallery into WordPress in just a few seconds. Best <a href=\"http://awplife.com/product/photo-gallery-premium/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Photo Gallery Premium</a> plugin for websites.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Display <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/responsive-slider-gallery/\" rel=\"ugc\">Slider Plugin</a> &#8211; Fully Responsive Slider Gallery For WordPress, You can Show Slider Into Page/Post &amp; Widget/Sidebar By Generate Shortcode. Another great <a href=\"http://awplife.com/product/responsive-slider-gallery-premium/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Responsive Slider Gallery Premium</a> plugin for you.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Create <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/new-contact-form-widget/\" rel=\"ugc\">Contact Form</a> &#8211; Contact Form Widget Shortcode Plugin For WordPress. Collect your <a href=\"http://awplife.com/product/contact-form-premium/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Contact Form Premium</a> plugin and never miss a customer query.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Best <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/slider-responsive-slideshow/\" rel=\"ugc\">Responsive Slider Plugin</a> &#8211; Fully Responsive Light Weight Easy Powerful WordPress Slider Slideshow Plugin. Buy <a href=\"http://awplife.com/product/slider-responsive-slideshow-premium/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Slider Responsive Slideshow Premium</a> plugin for your website.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Great <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/new-video-gallery/\" rel=\"ugc\">Video Gallery Plugin</a> &#8211; The Best Responsive video gallery For WordPress. Best Video Gallery Plugin is <a href=\"http://awplife.com/product/video-gallery-premium/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Video Gallery Premium</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Add <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/new-facebook-like-share-follow-button/\" rel=\"ugc\">Like Share Follow Button</a> &#8211; Display your Like Share Follow Button Plugin into Page/Post &amp; Widget/Sidebar in WordPress sites with very easily.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n",
